lighted zones, and watch your painting come to life - no skill required.\n\n50+ artworks across various themes - around 10 hours of gameplay.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\nAuto-correction system: your strokes snap perfectly into place - fast, effortless, and impossible to mess up\n{2485077265240201}\n\nRelaxing environments: 5 different moods, and passthrought mode\n{988961566892343}\n\n50+ beautiful artworks across various themes\n{2127700567773429}", "short_description": "An easy, guided, and relaxing paint-by-number experience. Choose a template, follow highlighted zones, and create beautiful art - no skill required."}]}, "developer_name": "Kanvaz Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://notasquare.notion.site/Kanvaz-Privacy-Policy-344d2dcc8f9580298830e4374505ecdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kanvaz Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@kanvaz-studio", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25881531238186880"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617847_1590613755353216_5645343798133577049_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_aEMr2H-Se4Q7kNvwFDmzJy&_nc_oc=Adrb5sA5ttn5mD6NYPP3T9Kb7BJwd8BO4b77mru__Wauo22jhDoO5NwwTQxrcNVn3GY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-d